  "name": "Qualified OR (8-Input)",
  "description": "The qualified OR function code monitors the status of up to eight digital inputs and produces an output signal based upon conditions set by S9 and S10. The output is a logic 1 or 0 and is based upon the number of inputs being less than, equal to, or greater than the number specified in S9 and the condition set by S10.",
